Package: gl-stereo-show
Architecture: any
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}, gl-stereo-savers (= ${binary:Version})
Description: Plasma idle stereo show
 Starts the stereo background on AC after 135 idle minutes, using Plasma's
 session state and a ten-minute saver rotation. Settings live in Plasma.
 .
 Sparky Stereo OS, Daniel Ramos's edition of SparkyLinux (by Paweł "pavroo" Pijanowski).

